Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:52.78,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1663,465)}City Square\NSky Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who do you think will win this time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:14.55,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1506,537)\fad(300,300)}Jin Wuxu\NSky Demon City's Head Administrator\NRank 400 000 Demonic Energy\N(Middle stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:15.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the 6 Commanders-in-Chief of the Sky Demon Country !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Xuan is about to be promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you making this face ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:41.75,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(632,537)}Huang Commander-in-Chief\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:45.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,These youngsters are really lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:48.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,for having a chance to get one of the two vacant positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,But compared to you, who got here without a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,they still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have time to make fun of me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:59.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you should take a closer look at the rising talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless you want someone to replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:08.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Demon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is dealing with state affairs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:31.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,and made a decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner shall be promoted to Vice Commander-in-Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,bestowed a dragon robe, a jade sash,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the command of 3 armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:44.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,All Demon Generals of the Sky Demon Country,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,step forward !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:51.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rules of the competition are:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:53.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Generals fight first
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then their helpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Win both duels to win the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:03.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Win 4 matches to advance to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,those who kill a Demon General
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon General Shi Xiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:18.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shi Xiao !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's top 3 in strength !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful aura !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one will dare to challenge him, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,With his strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's no wonder no one dares to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,If no challenger steps forward within 10 breaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:34.86,Second,,0,0,0,,I will !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:41.31,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300)\pos(1547,524)}Mu Yun\NDemon General\NRank 150 000 Demonic Energy\N(Late stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:41.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person cultivates
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Nine Deaths and Nine Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:45.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,is no match for Shi Xiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:08.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner is decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner is Shi Xiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:13.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now back down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:15.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,and send your helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:27.51,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1571,487)\fad(300,300)}Tian Lui\NGiant Spirit Sect disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy is strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's a prodigy of the Giant Spirit Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This fight will be worth watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:32.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,both duels need to be won.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if the helper wins this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mu Yun is still eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the point of this second duel ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:44.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:48.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Giant Spirit Sect's One Strength Breaks All Spells !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:21.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Generals are protected by imperial decree
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:28.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,but helpers are pigs waiting to be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,"Win both duels to win the match"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is clearly a slaughter fest for Demon Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:36.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon General don't fight to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:40.34,Second,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you outsiders are here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,for us to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mo Lihai,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:57.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will settle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,the debt from back then !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost to Mo Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to our agreement,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:06.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't fight today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:09.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,You,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:12.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,come up here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,where I can't kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon General Shi Xiao,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't challenge others anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stand to the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:35.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mo Lihai cannot fight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will tear you apart !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:45.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Xuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know this man ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,this young man will definitely place in the top 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,He might even win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even among Demon Generals, he's just average.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can an outsider like him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,possibly get first place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Vice-Commander Huang doesn't believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall we make a bet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he does not win the competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Heavenly Omen Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:28.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:30.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:32.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want your Mystic Yellow Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:42.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Vice-Commander Xuan is determined to gift me his Heavenly Omen Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take that bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:48.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he had also injured you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be making fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll go !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.59,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1548,595)\fad(300,300)}Ao Di\NDemon General\NRank 150 000 Demonic Energy\N(Late stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mo Lihai cannot fight
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this outsider won't dare to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will forge my name here !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:07.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can still kneel and beg for mercy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rules say that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you harm me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll be executed !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're noisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:31.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long you can dodge !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:47.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,You aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,a match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ao Di isn't that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it was Shi Xiao,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't have lasted a single move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:05.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,In order to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,he...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,he actually removed his armor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use his Life-artifact !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:29.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,block my Demon Beast's Blood God Arrow !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:40.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:41.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:52.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,he broke the rules !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:56.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rules say I can't kill a Demon General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't he still alive ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,You severed his meridians
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:08.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,and crippled him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,this duel !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ao Di's helper !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:24.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I... forfeit !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I forfeit !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,He forfeited just like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:29.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(152,485)\fad(800,800)}1 day later
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,The winner is Mo Lihai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 4 matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.59,0:11:50.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mo Lihai advances to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang, go back to the residence to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.47,0:11:54.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll still rely on you for the later rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,That guy just bullies people in the name of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.63,0:12:00.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once Brother Wang gains the Demon Emperor's favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,he won't dare to say a word !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,For her to seat beside the Demon Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:16.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could she be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Emperor's Sword Spirit !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:41.35,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: Little Black = Number Four
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:37.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,let Little Xu handle this !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Black taught me a secret move,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guarantee I can make the opponent scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using him to buy a little time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:47.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a decent plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sword Spirit of the Demon Emperor is actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:57.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,such a pretty little girl !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:02.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little beauty, Brother Xu is coming to dote on you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a filthy creature !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:06.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get away !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.51,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: Xu Liguo had fallen in love with the soul fragment of Mei Ji (in the artifact of the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, because of that fiend, my love was denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:16.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the heavens are blessing me today !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're both Sword Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are fated for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:31.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disgusting !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't go !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,You haven't finished your candied hawthorn yet !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:37.55,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: candied hawthorn is the snack she was eating, it has a connotation of romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:38.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,My... my...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,My little beauty !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:47.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,My little beauty and I were about to get together
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:48.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:49.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,you tore us apart !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:50.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,back then, you denied my love for the beauty in that artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,and now you're stopping me from pursuing this love !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous of my dashing looks
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,because you're all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can't stand to see others happy !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that all ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not done !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:03.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless you let me out to find the little beauty I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,My little beauty !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big brother is coming !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,My old restriction isn't strong enough to restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're forcing my hand !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.39,0:14:20.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Black,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:20.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Release the restriction immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:32.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fiend's strength is getting more and more terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:33.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I will fight
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:34.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,for my love !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:35.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Black !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:50.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:54.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you done ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master's cultivation is heavenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu will never dare to betray you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:06.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is so wise !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:09.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll never go find the little beauty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sky Demon City is filled with powerful experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:13.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you think no one would see you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,they would wipe out your consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,and enslave you into a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:22.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a Sword Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:24.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,which sword I'm in doesn't matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:27.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is right !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on, Little Xu will definitely get rid of his desires
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and will never have wicked thoughts !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both you and the half-moon blade
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:35.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,have learned quite a few skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Black has many techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can conceal its aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can even enhance the strength of a celestial sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:44.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivating them isn't easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:47.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, please be merciful and let it stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:54.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,My little beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder when we will meet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,someone wishes to see you in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The name of fellow cultivator Wang
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,was already famous back on planet Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I came here to express my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:17.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,In today's Demon General competition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you helped us understand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,how a cultivator should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:24.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the Demon Spirit Land,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,our lives are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Generals cannot be killed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,but helpers can be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:32.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only fellow cultivator Wang
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:35.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to repay them for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although military merit is important,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:38.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,we must be able to live through it !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this competition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,is just a way for them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,to sharpen their blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:45.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivators should act according to the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,not obstinate over futile things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have decided to withdraw from the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We came specially to bid farewell to fellow cultivator Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:58.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Generals are watching me like tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jin Wuxu kept targeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This rule that Demon Generals can't be killed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,might as well be my death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Act according to the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:51.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ming Xuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:52.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,From Qi Condensation all the way to Peak Late stage Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:34.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,which step
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,wasn't reached out of a desperate situation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivators should act according to the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:40.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,not obstinate over futile things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:43.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I had followed the will of the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be alive today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Withdrawing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not an option,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:04.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Defy the heavens with my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Defy the heavens by cultivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivate to defy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivate for freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:35.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Dao !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:55.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Defying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my path to the Ascendant realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a Dao Heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he is the person
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancestor has been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Accept your fate and stay mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,or defy it to become immortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:36.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens can't shake my Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they will try to eradicate my existence !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can destroy my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they can't destroy my Dao Heart !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the heavens want to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:20:59.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.87,0:21:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,destroy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who disturb my Ascendant breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,must die !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever wishes to kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall be trapped in my Underworld River,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,my own reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,free from the heavens and the earth !
